This example demonstrates a hybrid program.  The Curry part solves the classic
"Blocks World" puzzle.  A simple user interface to this is placed into a web
application using the Python Flask library.

The example needs the Flask package, which is not part of the staged
install, and its solver is slow.  The test suite does not run it.  See
19-blocks-world-app for a Blocks World application that needs only the
Python standard library.
